/**
 * Clean-page outcome. `consoleErrors` defaults to zero and is only ever raised
 * to the total of an application's exact, message-by-message console-error
 * inventory; the inventory itself is checked separately against the recorded
 * messages, so a raised total can never widen into a blanket allowance.
 */
